  "description": "We Have Another Profitable Acquisition To Gain From",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> 🔒 subscriber-only episode🔒 </strong></em>of StockTok. Here we discuss more on when to dollar cost average up, with a position that is already winning, Lemonade <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$LMND&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. Long story short, I want at least 10% profit and/or a breakout from a consolidation. If you are still unsure on how to DCA up, check out my video on <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to dollar cost average UP</a> here. Also…</p>",
